stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Starting: first tool call
    Starting --> Ready: ready within 60 s
    Starting --> Restarting: crash or boot deadline
    Ready --> Restarting: exits non-zero
    Restarting --> Starting: backoff 1s → 2s → 4s
    Restarting --> Dead: 3rd attempt fails
    Dead --> [*]: tools gone for the session<br/>host restart re-arms
    note right of Dead
        three strikes per runtime lifetime:
        the attempt counter never resets
    end note
